# The same rule from the other side. Both sides apply it to themselves without
# knowing whether the other side will, so an ordinary claim gives way too.
run claim M1-01
exit 4
claims M2-01
after M2-01
file tasks/M1-01.md
	---
	id: M1-01
	depends_on: []
	exclusive: no
	---
file tasks/M2-01.md
	---
	id: M2-01
	depends_on: []
	exclusive: yes
	---
stderr
	tasks.sh: claim on M1-01 released: the exclusive claim on M2-01 is in flight
